 past"},{"t":"be penkiolikos","f":"a quarter to ...","r":"15 minutes to"}]},{"id":"lt:c5","title":"@c_colours","level":"@beginner","intro":"@c_intro","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"juoda","f":"black","r":"YWOH-dah"},{"t":"balta","f":"white","r":"BAHL-tah"},{"t":"pilka","f":"gray","r":"PIHL-kah"},{"t":"raudona","f":"red","r":"row-DAW-nah"},{"t":"mėlyna","f":"blue","r":"MEHH-lee-nah"},{"t":"geltona","f":"yellow","r":"gahl-TAW-nah"},{"t":"žalia","f":"green","r":"ZHAH-lyah"},{"t":"oranžinė","f":"orange","r":"aw-rahn-ZHEE-nehh"},{"t":"violetinė","f":"purple","r":"vyaw-leh-TIH-nehh"},{"t":"ruda","f":"brown","r":"ROO-dah"},{"t":"rausvas","f":"pink","r":"ROWS-vahs"}]},{"id":"lt:c6","title":"@c_problems","level":"@elementary","intro":"@c_intro","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"Eik šalin.","f":"Leave me alone.","r":"EH-eek SHAH-leen"},{"t":"Nelieskite manęs!","f":"Don't touch me!","r":"neh-LYEHS-kee-teh MAH-nas"},{"t":"Aš iškviesiu policiją.","f":"I'll call the police.","r":"ahsh eesh-KVYEH-syoo paw-LIH-tsyah"},{"t":"Policija!","f":"Police!","r":"paw-LIH-tsyah"},{"t":"Stabdykite vagį!","f":"Stop! Thief!","r":"stahb-DEE-kee-teh VAH-gee"},{"t":"Man reikia jūsų pagalbos.","f":"I need your help.","r":"mahn REY-kyah YOO-soo pah-GAHL-bohs"},{"t":"Skubiai reikia pagalbos, rimtas atvejis.","f":"It's an urgent need for help, emergency","r":"skoo-BYAHEE REY-kyah pah-GAHL-bohs, REEM-tahs AHT-veh-ees"},{"t":"Aš pasiklydau.","f":"I'm lost.","r":"ahsh pah-see-KLEE-dow"},{"t":"Aš pamečiau savo rankinę.","f":"I lost my bag.","r":"ahsh pah-MEH-chyah-oo SAH-voh RAHN-kee-nehh"},{"t":"Aš pamečiau savo piniginę.","f":"I lost my wallet.","r":"ahsh pah-MEH-chyah-oo pee-NEE-gee-nehh"},{"t":"Man bloga.","f":"I'm sick.","r":"mahn BLAW-gah"},{"t":"Mane sužeidė.","f":"I've been injured.","r":"MAH-neh"},{"t":"Man reikia daktaro pagalbos.","f":"I need a doctor.","r":"mahn REY-kyah dahk-TAH-roh pah-GAHL-bohs"},{"t":"Ar galėčiau pasinaudoti jūsų telefonu?","f":"Can I use your phone?","r":"ahr gah-LEH-chyah-oo pah-see-NOW-daw-tee YOO-soo teh-leh-FAW"}]},{"id":"lt:c7","title":"@c_transport","level":"@elementary","intro":"Please note: In bigger Lithuanian cities there are so called \"route-taxis\" or \"micro-buses\" going in, they will stop to take you from the street if you raise your hand. The price is the same wherever you go, it is a lot cheaper than going by taxi and a little more expensive than travelling by bus. The disadvantage for non-Lithuanian speakers is that you have to tell the driver where you want to get off just before the stop.","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"Taksi!","f":"Taxi!","r":"TAHK-sih!"},{"t":"Nuvežkite mane į _____, prašau.","f":"Take me to _____, please.","r":"noo-vehzh-KIH-teh MAH-neh ee____, prah-SHAOO"},{"t":"Kiek kainuoja kelionė iki_____?","f":"How much does it cost to get to _____?","r":"kyehk KAI-nwoh-yah KEH-lyoh-nehh EE-kih___?"},{"t":"Nuvežkite mane ten, prašau","f":"Take me there, please.","r":"noo-vehzh-KIH-teh MAH-neh tehn, prah-SHAOO"},{"t":"automobilis/mašina","f":"car","r":"OW-toh-maw-bih-lihs/MAH-shih-nah"},{"t":"taksi","f":"taxi","r":"TAHK-sih"},{"t":"furgonas","f":"van","r":"FOOR-gaw-nahs"},{"t":"autobusas","f":"bus","r":"ow-TAW-buh-sahs"},{"t":"sunkvežimis","f":"truck","r":"my-nih-KAH-vih-mahs"},{"t":"dviratis","f":"bicycle","r":"DVIH-rah-tihs"},{"t":"motociklas","f":"motorcycle","r":"maw-taw-TSIH-klahs"},{"t":"troleibusas","f":"trolleybus","r":"traw-LAY-boo-sahs"},{"t":"tramvajus","f":"tram","r":"TRAHM-vai-oos"},{"t":"traukinys","f":"train","r":"trow-kih-NEES"},{"t":"laivas","f":"ship","r":"LAI-vahs"},{"t":"valtis","f":"boat","r":"VAHL-tihs"},{"t":"keltas","f":"ferry","r":"KEHL-tahs"},{"t":"lėktuvas","f":"airplane","r":"lehk-TOO-vahs"},{"t":"Sraigtasparnis","f":"helicopter","r":"sraig-tahs-PAHR-nihs"},{"t":"Kiek kainuoja bilietas iki _____?","f":"How much is a ticket to _____?","r":"kyek kai-NWAH-yah BIH-lyeh-tahs IH-kih?"},{"t":"Prašau vieną bilietą į _____.","f":"One ticket to _____, please.","r":"prah-SHOW VYEH-nahh BIH-l